        <mxCell id="c59" value="&lt;b&gt;What makes it federated:&lt;/b&gt; traffic data, replay buffers and optimizers never leave a worker process. Only network parameters travel — θ&lt;sup&gt;(r)&lt;/sup&gt; down (solid), θ&lt;sub&gt;c&lt;/sub&gt; and the sample count n&lt;sub&gt;c&lt;/sub&gt; up (dashed). The three workers train at the same time, one OS process per city." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#AA4A85;fillColor=#F6E6EF;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="860" width="1500" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
